  "body": "Some homes are more than bricks and walls. They are the backdrop to everyday life for morning routines, family dinners, quiet evenings, laughter with friends and the little moments that, over time, become treasured memories.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across a generous 198sqm floor area, this inviting four-bedroom home offers space, comfort and a wonderful sense of connection for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe home offers four generous size bedrooms and three bathrooms, including two ensuites, providing comfort and privacy for the whole family. The generously sized master bedroom provides a private retreat, complete with its own balcony. This is the perfect spot to step outside, unwind and take a quiet moment at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nWith two separate living areas, there is plenty of flexibility for the whole family. Enjoy time together in the main living space, while the second living area offers a quieter retreat, a space for the kids or an ideal spot to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is a little surprise as you make your way upstairs....Rangitoto gradually comes into view, creating a beautiful moment of discovery. It is a view that feels almost like a reward and something to pause and appreciate as you move through the home.\r\n\r\nOutside, the generously sheltered outdoor area provides a wonderful space for relaxed family living and entertaining. Whether it is a summer barbecue, an afternoon with friends or simply enjoying a quiet coffee outdoors, this is a space designed to be enjoyed throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nModern convenience comes naturally here, with a smart electronic lighting system allowing you to control the home's lighting with ease and create the right atmosphere for every occasion.\r\n\r\nAnd for families, the highly sought-after school zoning is a standout, Pigeon Mountain Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.\r\n\r\nDon't miss the opportunity. Give us a call today for a private viewing or to find out more.",
